'''Diluting Touch''' is a timed [[debuff]] caused by monsters with the [[Delirium league|Delirium]] modifier of [[Modifier:MonsterAfflictionMagicRewardDebuffFlaskEffect~|the same name]]. Players gain fewer flask charges and have reduced flask effect while affected by Diluting Touch. It can stack up to 10 times.

==See also==
* [[Beacon of Madness]] unique boots
** {{sl|Embrace Madness}}
==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.10.0d|
* Delirium modifiers are now applied on a per-pack basis. This means that a given pack of monsters will only have a single Delirium modifier, rather than potentially having a variety of different modifiers.
* Significantly reduced the chance of Delirium modifiers appearing on monsters.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.10.0c|
* Reduced the duration of the [[Wasting Touch]], [[Paralysing Touch]], [[Eroding Touch]] and '''Diluting Touch''' debuffs to three seconds.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.10.0|
* Introduced to the game.
}}
{{Version history table end}}

